65
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:07,000
Press Ctrl plus Z to cancel.

66
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:11,000
Press Ctrl plus Y to restore.

67
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:14,000
After editing the needle design or parameters,

68
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:19,000
