69
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:22,000
This new function makes the design process more convenient,

70
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,000
allowing you to easily try different needle structures,

71
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
and quickly modify any changes.

72
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
In the 2026.0 version,

73
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:37,000
the 3D zipper supports custom zipper.

74
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:44,000
First, we need to adjust the custom zipper OBJ file to the appropriate size and position.

75
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,000
The zipper size is adjusted according to the actual zipper size.

76
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,000
The zipper position needs to be ensured on both sides.

77
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,000
The zipper overlap position is located at the coordinate point.

78
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
We can copy it,

79
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,000
paste it,

80
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,000
and put the zipper overlap on both sides.

81
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:02,000
Then delete the zipper on one side.

82
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Delete a zipper that can be used to define the OBJ.

83
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Select the file to delete OBJ.

84
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:13,000
After deleting the OBJ dialogue frame,

85
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:16,000
click OK.

86
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,000
In the main menu bar,

87
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:22,000
find the material, UV, zipper, custom OBJ,

88
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
