91
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:36,000
and click the plus sign on the right to customize the zipper operation.

92
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,000
In the dialogue frame that is displayed,

93
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,000
change the name of the zipper.

94
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Increase the zipper OBJ file,

95
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
you can view the effect in the window view in the browser.

96
00:05:46,000 --> 00:06:02,980
Adjust the

97
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,000
zipper direction appropriately.

98
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Click to confirm the customized zipper is completed.

99
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,000
This new function can help you customize various zippers.

